# Issue #143: a stray flow dropped at a realization stays dropped. The
# strict filter vetoes B -> C (it touches C, D's upstream neighbor, and
# is no path flow); "process Z" realizes the compound; the plain filter
# of the next compound cannot re-allow B -> C, gone from the view.
# Expected: B, C, D, Z, and C -> D only.
#include tests/non-regression/093-filter-merge-master.dfd

!!<1 D
! B
process Z
! B C D Z
